                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta_\mathbb{Z}^{+, 0, s} \equiv \beta_\mathbb{Z}^{\mathbb{Z}, 0, s}(0, \lambda n:\mathbb{Z}.s, \lambda n:\mathbb{Z}.s, \lambda m:\mathbb{Z}.\lambda n:\mathbb{Z}.s \circ s):\prod_{x:\mathbb{Z}} 0 + s(x) =_{\mathbb{Z}} ((\lambda n:\mathbb{Z}.s)(x))(0 + x)
