          %h3#multiplication_on_the_integers Multiplication on the integers
          %p To do: figure out a way to prove the various properties of multiplication without using the fact that the integers are a set (i.e. the integers are a non-coherently abelian H-ring).
          %p
          .num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p
              Since the integers are a non-coherently abelian H-group with respect to addition, right addition by an integer
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
